    <div class="article-body">
      <p>Dairy Queen offers over 20 Blizzard flavors at any given time — a mix of year-round classics and rotating seasonal specials. With that many choices, knowing which to order and which to skip saves real money and prevents dessert regret. We have tasted and ranked every current Blizzard on <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a>.</p>
